# Project core

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `roles.md` at session start.
- Never commit secrets, bot tokens, private keys, or seed phrases.
- Prefer small diffs; one concern per change.
- Update `AGENT_CLAIMS.md` before editing shared or contested paths.
- Wallet signing, key custody, and fund-moving paths default to Codex ownership.
- Keep `.env.example` as names-only documentation; real secrets stay out of git.
